flowchart TD
    Update[状态更新请求] --> LaneCheck{Lane 优先级比较}

    LaneCheck -->|最高优先级| InputLane[InputDiscreteLane<br/>输入事件]
    LaneCheck -->|普通优先级| DefaultLane[DefaultLane<br/>普通 setState]
    LaneCheck -->|低优先级| TransitionLane[TransitionLane<br/>startTransition 包裹的更新]

    InputLane --> SyncRender[同步立即渲染]
    DefaultLane --> BatchRender[批量合并渲染]
    TransitionLane --> SliceRender[可打断的时间切片渲染]

    SliceRender --> Interrupt{有高优先级任务插入?}

    Interrupt -->|Yes - InputDiscreteLane| Pause[暂停当前 transition]
    Pause --> Save[保存 workInProgress 进度]
    Save --> HighPri[处理高优先级更新]
    HighPri --> Discard[丢弃过期 transition]
    Discard --> Restart[基于最新状态重新调度]

    Interrupt -->|No| Continue[继续时间切片]
    Continue --> CheckNode[每处理一个 fiber 节点]
    CheckNode --> ShouldYield{"shouldYield()"?}
    ShouldYield -->|Yes - 帧时间不足 5ms| Yield[让出主线程]
    Yield --> Resume[下一帧通过 scheduleCallback 恢复]
    Resume --> CheckNode
    ShouldYield -->|No| NextNode[处理下一个节点]
    NextNode --> CheckNode
